                             "content":  "Your students don\u0027t just read about code, they write it. Spaces is a browser-based code editor where learners can practice, build projects, and host real websites. No installs, no setup, no IT tickets.\n\n check_circle\n\n Browser-Based Editor\n\n Works on any device, nothing to install\n\n check_circle\n\n Free Hosting\n\n Students can share their work with a link\n\n check_circle\n\n kAI Coding Tutor\n\n AI help for debugging and learning\n\n check_circle\n\n Ready-Made Templates\n\n Portfolio, blog, web shop, and more\n\n Try Spaces Free\n\n Learn More\n\n my-project\n\n HTML\n CSS\n JS\n\n 1\u003ch1\u003eMy First Website\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n 2\u003cp\u003eBuilt with Spaces!\u003c/p\u003e\n\n 3\u003cbutton onclick=\"go()\"\u003e\n\n 4 Click Me\n\n 5\u003c/button\u003e\n\n kAI\n\n Ask kAI for help...\n\n language\n\n username.w3spaces.com\n\n Live and hosted, free SSL included\n\n check_circle\n\n Supports\n\n HTML/CSS/JS\n PHP\n Python\n Node.js",
