                             "content":  "TS Editor\nTS Exercises\nTS Quiz\nTS Practice Problems\nTS Syllabus\nTS Study Plan\n\nny:--\u003e\n\n ny:--\u003e\n\nny:--\u003e\n\n TypeScript with React\n\n ❮ Previous\n Next ❯",
                             "heading":  "TypeScript Exercises"
