                                  "code":  "// Bad: Silent failure\n\n try { /* ... */ } catch { /* empty */ }\n\n // Good: At least log the error\n\n try { /* ... */ } catch (error) {\n\n   console.error(\u0027Operation failed:\u0027, error);\n\n }",
